60c-26.51 0-48-21.49-48-48s21.49-48 48-48 48 21.49 48 48-21.49 48-48 48zm513.941 133.823L421.823 497.941c-18.745 18.745-49.137 18.745-67.882 0l-.36-.36L527.64 323.522c16.999-16.999 26.36-39.6 26.36-63.64s-9.362-46.641-26.36-63.64L331.397 0h48.721a48 48 0 0 1 33.941 14.059l211.882 211.882c18.745 18.745 18.745 49.137 0 67.882z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-tags\"></i> -->\n    \n      <a href=\"/tags/#Google Cloud\" class=\"page__meta btn\" rel=\"tag\">Google Cloud</a>\n    \n      <a href=\"/tags/#GRTE\" class=\"page__meta btn\" rel=\"tag\">GRTE</a>\n    \n  </article>","link":"https://slayer0x.github.io/GRTE/","retrieved":1726531200000},{"title":"SkullNet Writeup","contents":"<article class=\"archive__item\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/CreativeWork\">\n    \n    <h2 class=\"archive__item-title\" itemprop=\"headline\">\n      \n        <a href=\"/SkullNet/\" rel=\"permalink\">SkullNet Writeup\n</a>\n        \n      \n    </h2>\n\n    <p class=\"page__meta\">\n      \n        <svg class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-calendar fa-w-14 fa-fw\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fa\" data-icon=\"calendar\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" data-fa-i2svg=\"\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 192h424c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v260c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V204c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12zm436-44v-36c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48h-48V12c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v52H160V12c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v52H48C21.5 64 0 85.5 0 112v36c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h424c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> --> <time datetime=\"2024-07-29T00:00:00+00:00\">July 29, 2024 </time> \n      \n      \n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"archive__item-excerpt\" itemprop=\"description\"><img src=\"/assets/images/skullnet/icon.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: right;margin-right:10px; margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:10px; height:120px;\">Welcome to the review of SkullNet, my first CTF available out there, you have what it takes to solve it and become a SkullOperator? Show your skills in this CTF and retrieve the secret Flag!\n</p>\n    <svg class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-tags fa-w-20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"tags\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" data-fa-i2svg=\"\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M497.941 225.941L286.059 14.059A48 48 0 0 0 252.118 0H48C21.49 0 0 21.49 0 48v204.118a48 48 0 0 0 14.059 33.941l211.882 211.882c18.744 18.745 49.136 18.746 67.882 0l204.118-204.118c18.745-18.745 18.745-49.137 0-67.882zM112 160c-26.51 0-48-21.49-48-48s21.49-48 48-48 48 21.49 48 48-21.49 48-48 48zm513.941 133.823L421.823 497.941c-18.745 18.745-49.137 18.745-67.882 0l-.36-.36L527.64 323.522c16.999-16.999 26.36-39.6 26.36-63.64s-9.362-46.641-26.36-63.64L331.397 0h48.721a48 48 0 0 1 33.941 14.059l211.882 211.882c18.745 18.745 18.745 49.137 0 67.882z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-tags\"></i> -->\n    \n      <a href=\"/tags/#SkullNet\" class=\"page__meta btn\" rel=\"tag\">SkullNet</a>\n    \n      <a href=\"/tags/#CTF\" class=\"page__meta btn\" rel=\"tag\">CTF</a>\n    \n  </article>","link":"https://slayer0x.github.io/SkullNet/","retrieved":1722211200000},{"title":"HackTricks ARTE Review","contents":"<article class=\"archive__item\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/CreativeWork\">\n    \n    <h2 class=\"archive__item-title\" itemprop=\"headline\">\n      \n        <a href=\"/ARTE/\" rel=\"permalink\">HackTricks ARTE Review\n</a>\n        \n      \n    </h2>\n\n    <p class=\"page__meta\">\n      \n        <svg class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-calendar fa-w-14 fa-fw\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fa\" data-icon=\"calendar\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" data-fa-i2svg=\"\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 192h424c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v260c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V204c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12zm436-44v-36c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48h-48V12c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v52H160V12c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v52H48C21.5 64 0 85.5 0 112v36c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h424c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> --> <time datetime=\"2024-04-17T00:00:00+00:00\">April 17, 2024 </time> \n      \n      \n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"archive__item-excerpt\" itemprop=\"description\"><img src=\"/assets/images/arte/icon.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: right;margin-right:10px; margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:10px; height:120px;\">Starting from the basics deepen your expertise in AWS security with a comprehensive exploration of advanced concepts, including in-depth identity and access management strategies, encryption methods, sophisticated networking defenses and learn how to spot and exploit misconfigurations in more than 20 common AWS services. Master the application of specialized red team and whitebox tactics in AWS contexts, enabling the detection and correction of complex security flaws.\n</p>\n    <svg class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-tags fa-w-20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"tags\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" data-fa-i2svg=\"\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M497.941 225.941L286.059 14.059A48 48 0 0 0 252.118 0H48C21.49 0 0 21.49 0 48v204.118a48 48 0 0 0 14.059 33.941l211.882 211.882c18.744 18.745 49.136 18.746 67.882 0l204.118-204.118c18.745-18.745 18.745-49.137 0-67.882zM112 160c-26.51 0-48-21.49-48-48s21.49-48 48-48 48 21.49 48 48-21.49 48-48 48zm513.941 133.823L421.823 497.941c-18.745 18.745-49.137 18.745-67.882 0l-.36-.36L527.64 323.522c16.999-16.999 26.36-39.6 26.36-63.64s-9.362-46.641-26.36-63.64L331.397 0h48.721a48 48 0 0 1 33.941 14.059l211.882 211.882c18.745 18.745 18.745 49.137 0 67.882z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-tags\"></i> -->\n    \n      <a href=\"/tags/#Amazon AWS\" class=\"page__meta btn\" rel=\"tag\">Amazon AWS</a>\n    \n      <a href=\"/tags/#ARTE\" class=\"page__meta btn\" rel=\"tag\">ARTE</a>\n    \n  </article>","link":"https://slayer0x.github.io/ARTE/","retrieved":1713312000000},{"title":"OSCP All you need to know","contents":"<article class=\"archive__item\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/CreativeWork\">\n    \n    <h2 class=\"archive__item-title\" itemprop=\"headline\">\n      \n        <a href=\"/oscp/\" rel=\"permalink\">OSCP All you need to know\n</a>\n        \n      \n    </h2>\n\n    <p class=\"page__meta\">\n      \n        <svg class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-calendar fa-w-14 fa-fw\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fa\" data-icon=\"calendar\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" data-fa-i2svg=\"\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 192h424c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v260c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V204c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12zm436-44v-36c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48h-48V12c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v52H160V12c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v52H48C21.5 64 0 85.5 0 112v36c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h424c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> --> <time datetime=\"2023-12-23T00:00:00+00:00\">December 23, 2023 </time> \n      \n      \n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"archive__item-excerpt\" itemprop=\"description\"><img src=\"/assets/images/oscp/logo.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: right;margin-right:10px; margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:10px; height:120px;\">The OSCP is a hands-on penetration testing certification, requiring holders to successfully attack and penetrate various live machines in a safe lab environment. It is considered more technical than other ethical hacking certifications, and is one of the few certifications that requires evidence of practical penetration testing skills.\n</p>\n    <svg class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-tags fa-w-20\" aria-