as\" data-icon=\"tags\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" data-fa-i2svg=\"\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M497.941 225.941L286.059 14.059A48 48 0 0 0 252.118 0H48C21.49 0 0 21.49 0 48v204.118a48 48 0 0 0 14.059 33.941l211.882 211.882c18.744 18.745 49.136 18.746 67.882 0l204.118-204.118c18.745-18.745 18.745-49.137 0-67.882zM112 160c-26.51 0-48-21.49-48-48s21.49-48 48-48 48 21.49 48 48-21.49 48-48 48zm513.941 133.823L421.823 497.941c-18.745 18.745-49.137 18.745-67.882 0l-.36-.36L527.64 323.522c16.999-16.999 26.36-39.6 26.36-63.64s-9.362-46.641-26.36-63.64L331.397 0h48.721a48 48 0 0 1 33.941 14.059l211.882 211.882c18.745 18.745 18.745 49.137 0 67.882z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-tags\"></i> -->\n    \n      <a href=\"/tags/#eCPPTv2\" class=\"page__meta btn\" rel=\"tag\">eCPPTv2</a>\n    \n  </article>","link":"https://slayer0x.github.io/ecpptv2/","retrieved":1683158400000},{"title":"Create your Pivoting networks with Vmware","contents":"<article class=\"archive__item\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/CreativeWork\">\n    \n    <h2 class=\"archive__item-title\" itemprop=\"headline\">\n      \n        <a href=\"/vmware-networks/\" rel=\"permalink\">Create your Pivoting networks with Vmware\n</a>\n        \n      \n    </h2>\n\n    <p class=\"page__meta\">\n      \n        <svg class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-calendar fa-w-14 fa-fw\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fa\" data-icon=\"calendar\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" data-fa-i2svg=\"\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 192h424c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v260c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V204c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12zm436-44v-36c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48h-48V12c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v52H160V12c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v52H48C21.5 64 0 85.5 0 112v36c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h424c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> --> <time datetime=\"2023-04-28T00:00:00+00:00\">April 28, 2023 </time> \n      \n      \n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"archive__item-excerpt\" itemprop=\"description\"><img src=\"/assets/images/networks/vmware.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: right;margin-right:10px; margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:10px; height:120px;\">VMware is a software company that provides virtualization and cloud computing software and services. Virtualization technology allows multiple operating systems to run on a single physical computer, enabling hardware resources to be shared among multiple virtual machines. This technology helps businesses to reduce costs by increasing server utilization, consolidating servers, and reducing power consumption.\n</p>\n    <svg class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-tags fa-w-20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"tags\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" data-fa-i2svg=\"\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M497.941 225.941L286.059 14.059A48 48 0 0 0 252.118 0H48C21.49 0 0 21.49 0 48v204.118a48 48 0 0 0 14.059 33.941l211.882 211.882c18.744 18.745 49.136 18.746 67.882 0l204.118-204.118c18.745-18.745 18.745-49.137 0-67.882zM112 160c-26.51 0-48-21.49-48-48s21.49-48 48-48 48 21.49 48 48-21.49 48-48 48zm513.941 133.823L421.823 497.941c-18.745 18.745-49.137 18.745-67.882 0l-.36-.36L527.64 323.522c16.999-16.999 26.36-39.6 26.36-63.64s-9.362-46.641-26.36-63.64L331.397 0h48.721a48 48 0 0 1 33.941 14.059l211.882 211.882c18.745 18.745 18.745 49.137 0 67.882z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-tags\"></i> -->\n    \n      <a href=\"/tags/#Networking\" class=\"page__meta btn\" rel=\"tag\">Networking</a>\n    \n      <a href=\"/tags/#eCPPTv2\" class=\"page__meta btn\" rel=\"tag\">eCPPTv2</a>\n    \n  </article>","link":"https://slayer0x.github.io/vmware-networks/","retrieved":1682640000000}]}